message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated article."
title: "Pabna urban tree canopy and biomass pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Code for mapping urban tree canopy, above-ground biomass and carbon stock in
  Pabna Municipality, Bangladesh, by training a satellite canopy classifier on
  reference data generated from UAV imagery with deep learning segmentation.
